      "widgets_values": [
        "convert the depth map to realistic image. Detailed Description:\nThis is the third image from the same high-end R-18 erotic cosplay photoshoot series.\nCharacter / Subject\n\nThe same model: a young East Asian woman with long black hair styled in twin tails tied with red ribbons.\nShe wears only partial remnants of the red and gold traditional Japanese/Chinese-inspired demon/oni shrine maiden costume — specifically the ornate red arm sleeves with gold trim and black accents. The rest of her body is completely nude.\nA small, intricate red floral/crest tattoo or body paint design is visible on her lower back, just above her buttocks.\n\nPose\nA top-down (high-angle) view shows her lying face-down on a tatami mat in a very submissive, arched position:\n\nHer upper body is lowered with arms stretched forward, hands placed flat on the floor in front of her (fingers with bright red nail polish).\nHer back is strongly arched, pushing her hips and round buttocks upward toward the camera in a pronounced “face down, ass up” pose.\nHer head is turned down and resting on the mat, obscuring her facial expression.\n\nLocation / Setting\nThe scene is set in an elaborate traditional Japanese-style room:\n\nTatami mat flooring with decorative borders.\nA low dark wooden table in the background holds various props: a white and red kitsune (fox) mask, a small lantern emitting warm light, a sake bottle, cups, and scattered cherry blossom petals.\nAbundant pink cherry blossom arrangements, red drapery, and a large decorative folding fan with floral patterns.\nRed paper lanterns and other traditional ornaments complete the atmospheric, intimate setting.\n\nAdditional Details\n\nThe disassembled cosplay pieces (red and gold fabrics, purple gloves, red ropes with golden bells, and another mask) are scattered around her on the floor, enhancing the “aftermath” or undressing narrative.\nSoft, warm red-toned lighting creates dramatic highlights on her oiled skin and curves.\nThe artist’s signature “GachY 2025.5” appears on the left side of the image.\n\nOverall Impression: This image shifts to a more artistic, voyeuristic top-down perspective, emphasizing the model’s back, hips, and buttocks. It maintains the sensual, high-production erotic cosplay aesthetic of the series while conveying a submissive, intimate mood through the prone arched pose and the “costume discarded” scene."
